    "body": "It seems reasonable... I can't think of any other good behaviors at least. It's a bit surprising how BYOB becomes a footgun. I wonder if user-allocated buffer + has read ack would be better? If so maybe we should not have user-allocated buffer without ack at all?\n\nHmm, but I wonder if MSE for example will never be done with the buffer and so would just never ack. Maybe that's OK?\n",
